@startmindmap
title Behavioral Design Patterns Overview

* Behavioral\nPatterns
** Chain of\nResponsibility
*** Pass requests along\na chain of handlers
** Command
*** Turn requests into\nstand-alone objects
** Iterator
*** Traverse collections\nwithout exposing internals
** Mediator
*** Reduce chaotic dependencies\nbetween objects
** Memento
*** Save and restore\nprevious states
** Observer
*** Notify multiple objects\nabout state changes
** State
*** Alter behavior when\ninternal state changes
** Strategy
*** Define interchangeable\nalgorithm families
** Template Method
*** Define algorithm skeleton,\ndefer steps to subclasses
** Visitor
*** Separate algorithms from\nthe objects they operate on

@endmindmap
